<title>NETHERLANDS: Philips 1996 profit slides, div maintained.</title>
<headline>Philips 1996 profit slides, div maintained.</headline>
<dateline>EINDHOVEN, Netherlands 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>  Net from normal operations   profit 723 vs 2.68 bln profit</p>
<p>  Net from normal/shr (guilders)     2.11 vs 7.90</p>
<p>  Total net loss			    590 vs 2.52 bln profit</p>
<p>  Total net/shr (guilders)	loss 1.73 vs 7.41 profit</p>
<p>  Dividend (guilders)		    1.60 vs same</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected Philips Electronics NV would make net profit from normal operations of 1.09 billion to 1.53 billion guilders.  </p>
<p>  Net sales (billions)		  69.20 vs 64.46</p>
<p>  Income from ops (billions)	   1.81 vs 4.04</p>
<p>  Income before taxes		     914 vs 3.35 bln</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
